> Also, is there a way of finding out what you can
> invoke from items (like Magicbane...) without
> reading the spoilers? I'm attempting to remain as
> purist as possible.... Thanks again!

NetHack, like the artificat in the book Rogue Moon,
has a pretty simple rule: it only costs you one game,
and one life, to find out what anything does by
trying it to see. An athame is a knife, and Magic
Bane is an athame, though in NetHack that makes it
technically a dagger. Try stabbing things with it.
Probably you can do other stuff with it too, if they
involve cutting somehow.

Lots of stuff in NetHack does lots of the things
you'd expect it to do. Then, there's the rest. The
immensely large rest.

